      "note": "Normalization removes radial signal initially. Because labels directly move each point, this sandbox can still fit the labels; it does not test an encoder’s ability to recover that lost signal."
    },
    {
      "id": "easy-triplets",
      "name": "small margin",
      "dataset": "blobs",
      "param": 0.05,
      "note": "One positive and one negative are sampled for each eligible anchor per step. Satisfied triplets contribute zero. A fresh sample may still be active."
    },
